      <string id="P_general_language">Language</string>
      <string id="P_general_language_Help">Language of the user interface.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.language</string>
      <string id="P_general_language_auto">automatic</string>
      <string id="P_general_language_en">English</string>
      <string id="P_general_language_de">Deutsch</string>
      <string id="P_general_mode">Default mode</string>
      <string id="P_general_mode_Help">Mode used by the action "Process clipboard (default mode)".

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.mode</string>
      <string id="P_general_mode_pseudonymize">Pseudonymise</string>
      <string id="P_general_mode_anonymize">Anonymise</string>
      <string id="P_general_mode_redact">Redact</string>
      <string id="P_general_notify">Notification after an action</string>
      <string id="P_general_notify_Help">Show a tray notification after each action.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.notify</string>
      <string id="P_general_autostart">Start with the user session</string>
      <string id="P_general_autostart_Help">Start the program at logon (per user). The MSI property AUTOSTART=1 sets this up for all users instead.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.autostart</string>
      <string id="P_general_history_store_originals">History keeps original text</string>
      <string id="P_general_history_store_originals_Help">If disabled, the history (RAM, and projects with history) shows only masked originals.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.history_store_originals</string>
      <string id="P_general_workbench_auto_copy">Workbench copies the result</string>
      <string id="P_general_workbench_auto_copy_Help">The workbench puts each result into the clipboard.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: general.workbench_auto_copy</string>
      <string id="P_project_os_encryption">Encrypt projects with the Windows account (DPAPI)</string>
      <string id="P_project_os_encryption_Help">Projects without a passphrase are encrypted with a key that only the user's Windows account can use. Disabling this stores them as readable JSON.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: project.os_encryption</string>
      <string id="P_processing_anonymize_style">Anonymisation style</string>
      <string id="P_processing_anonymize_style_Help">Realistic values or &lt;TYPE_n&gt; placeholders.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: processing.anonymize_style</string>
      <string id="P_processing_anonymize_style_realistic">realistic values (irreversible)</string>
      <string id="P_processing_anonymize_style_placeholder">placeholders &lt;TYPE_n&gt;</string>
      <string id="P_processing_redact_template">Redaction text</string>
      <string id="P_processing_redact_template_Help">Replacement text for "Redact"; {type} is replaced by the finding type.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: processing.redact_template</string>
      <string id="P_clipboard_process_html">Process HTML clipboard content</string>
      <string id="P_clipboard_process_html_Help">Process the HTML version (Outlook, Teams, browser) together with the text.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: clipboard.process_html</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode">Watcher mode</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode_Help">off: no watching. notify: popup when something sensitive is copied. critical automatically: secrets, keys, IBANs and cards are processed at once. always: everything copied is processed.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: watcher.mode</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode_off">off</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode_notify">notify</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode_critical">critical automatically</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_mode_always">always</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_action">Action in mode "always"</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_action_Help">What the watcher does in mode "always".

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: watcher.action</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_action_pseudonymize">Pseudonymise</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_action_anonymize">Anonymise</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_action_redact">Redact</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_action">Action for critical findings</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_action_Help">What the watcher does with critical findings in mode "critical automatically".

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: watcher.critical_action</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_action_pseudonymize">Pseudonymise</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_action_anonymize">Anonymise</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_action_redact">Redact</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_notify_noncritical">Popup for non-critical findings</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_notify_noncritical_Help">In mode "critical automatically": ask for other findings.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: watcher.notify_noncritical</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_types">Critical finding types</string>
      <string id="P_watcher_critical_types_Help">Types handled automatically in mode "critical automatically", e.g. PRIVATE_KEY, SECRET, IBAN, CREDIT_CARD. Replaces the user's selection.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: watcher.critical_types</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_pem">Detector: PEM keys / certificates</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_pem_Help">Enable or disable this detector.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: detectors.enabled.pem</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_tokens">Detector: Known token formats (GitLab, GitHub, AWS, JWT …)</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_tokens_Help">Enable or disable this detector.

