      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_kv_secrets_Help">Enable or disable this detector.

If configured, the user cannot change this setting. Setting: detectors.enabled.kv-secrets</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_entropy">Detector: High-entropy strings (may over-match)</string>
      <string id="P_detectors_enabled_entropy_Help">Enable or disable this detector.

